                        "entry_id": "004cdf72-73d3-3093-b5f3-ca574799fd1d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to brainwash, to make viewers/readers fool by a massive propaganda in the media, to affect their will as if they were zombies"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae7e2be5-125c-495f-987a-42a95e53b03f",
                                "sense_id": "4d1245aa-bb4c-3020-8fdd-44b09fde1575",
                                "text": "Мне сказа́ли, что рекла́ма гру́зит челове́ка, нас зомби́руют, что́бы мы покупа́ли това́ры.",
                                "translation": "I was told that advertising confuses (literally: \"loads\", slang meaning) people, we are brainwashed to buy products.",
